From: =?UTF-8?q?Bruno=20Greg=C3=B3rio?= <accounts@bruno.pw>
Date: Thu, 8 Oct 2026 16:41:13 -0300
Subject: [PATCH] dt-bindings: soc: qcom: qcom,pmic-glink: Add SM6450
MIME-Version: 1.0
Content-Type: text/plain; charset=UTF-8
Content-Transfer-Encoding: 8bit

Document the PMIC GLINK interface on SM6450. Its ADSP firmware offers
the battery manager, UCSI and alt mode services over the PMIC_RTR_ADSP_APPS
channel, as on the SoCs already listed with the generic fallback.

Signed-off-by: Bruno Gregório <accounts@bruno.pw>
---
 Documentation/devicetree/bindings/soc/qcom/qcom,pmic-glink.yaml | 1 +
 1 file changed, 1 insertion(+)

diff --git a/Documentation/devicetree/bindings/soc/qcom/qcom,pmic-glink.yaml b/Documentation/devicetree/bindings/soc/qcom/qcom,pmic-glink.yaml
index 7085bf88a..8ed9cb3c1 100644
--- a/Documentation/devicetree/bindings/soc/qcom/qcom,pmic-glink.yaml
+++ b/Documentation/devicetree/bindings/soc/qcom/qcom,pmic-glink.yaml
@@ -26,6 +26,7 @@ properties:
               - qcom,qcm6490-pmic-glink
               - qcom,sc8180x-pmic-glink
               - qcom,sc8280xp-pmic-glink
+              - qcom,sm6450-pmic-glink
               - qcom,sm8350-pmic-glink
               - qcom,sm8450-pmic-glink
               - qcom,sm8550-pmic-glink
